If you mean a **training dataset for an AI agent that can control a computer** (mouse, keyboard, apps, files, browser, etc.), you typically want examples of **intent → action sequence → result**.

Here is a small starter dataset in JSONL format:

```jsonl
{"id":"001","task":"Open a web browser and search for weather in Melbourne","goal":"Find current weather information","steps":[{"action":"click","target":"browser icon"},{"action":"type","text":"weather Melbourne"},{"action":"press","key":"ENTER"}],"expected_result":"Browser displays weather results for Melbourne"}

{"id":"002","task":"Create a new folder called Projects on the desktop","goal":"Create folder","steps":[{"action":"right_click","target":"desktop"},{"action":"select","option":"New Folder"},{"action":"type","text":"Projects"},{"action":"press","key":"ENTER"}],"expected_result":"A folder named Projects appears on the desktop"}

{"id":"003","task":"Open a text editor and write a note","goal":"Create a text file","steps":[{"action":"open","application":"Text Editor"},{"action":"type","text":"Meeting notes for tomorrow"},{"action":"save_file","filename":"notes.txt"}],"expected_result":"A saved text file named notes.txt exists"}

{"id":"004","task":"Copy a file named report.pdf to a backup folder","goal":"Duplicate file","steps":[{"action":"open","folder":"Documents"},{"action":"select","file":"report.pdf"},{"action":"copy"},{"action":"open","folder":"Backup"},{"action":"paste"}],"expected_result":"report.pdf exists in Backup folder"}

{"id":"005","task":"Send an email saying the meeting is confirmed","goal":"Send email","steps":[{"action":"open","application":"Email"},{"action":"click","target":"Compose"},{"action":"type","field":"body","text":"The meeting is confirmed."},{"action":"click","target":"Send"}],"expected_result":"Email is sent"}

{"id":"006","task":"Rename a file from draft.docx to final.docx","goal":"Rename file","steps":[{"action":"select","file":"draft.docx"},{"action":"right_click"},{"action":"choose","option":"Rename"},{"action":"type","text":"final.docx"},{"action":"press","key":"ENTER"}],"expected_result":"File is renamed to final.docx"}

{"id":"007","task":"Open calculator and calculate 245 multiplied by 12","goal":"Perform calculation","steps":[{"action":"open","application":"Calculator"},{"action":"type","text":"245*12"},{"action":"press","key":"ENTER"}],"expected_result":"Calculator shows 2940"}

{"id":"008","task":"Download an image from a webpage","goal":"Save image locally","steps":[{"action":"open","application":"Browser"},{"action":"navigate","url":"https://example.com"},{"action":"right_click","target":"image"},{"action":"select","option":"Save image"}],"expected_result":"Image is saved to computer"}

{"id":"009","task":"Close all open windows","goal":"Clean desktop","steps":[{"action":"identify_open_windows"},{"action":"click","target":"close_button","repeat":true}],"expected_result":"No application windows remain open"}

{"id":"010","task":"Create a spreadsheet with a list of expenses","goal":"Create spreadsheet","steps":[{"action":"open","application":"Spreadsheet"},{"action":"enter_data","cells":{"A1":"Item","B1":"Cost","A2":"Food","B2":"50"}},{"action":"save_file","filename":"expenses.xlsx"}],"expected_result":"Spreadsheet saved as expenses.xlsx"}
```

For a **larger, production-grade computer-control dataset**, use fields like:

```json
